<title>THAILAND: Thai Danu Bank unaudited 1996 net rises.</title>
<headline>Thai Danu Bank unaudited 1996 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited financial results for Thai Danu Bank for the year ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>		   (in millions of baht unless stated)</p>
<p>				     For 12 months</p>
<p>				   1996	  1995</p>
<p>    Shr (baht)		 9.32	  9.73</p>
<p>    Net		     1000.09	815.83</p>
<p>NOTES: Company's full name is Thai Danu Bank.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom 662-652-0642</p>
</text>
